'''Bermuda''' is the 35th stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. [[Kang Roo]] is introduced here. After completing this stage in Chapter 2, [[Panties Cat (Special Cat)|Panties Cat]] will be available to unlock from the [[Upgrade Menu]].

