==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Tokyo Prefecture'''.
*Bermuda's base is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Bermuda Triangle|Bermuda Triangle]], an area of the North Atlantic Ocean in which dozens of aircraft, ships and people are said to have disappeared mysteriously.
*Tokyo Prefecture's base is the [[wikipedia:Tokyo Tower|Tokyo Tower]], the second-largest structure in Japan.
*In the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch Version]], this stage uses [[New York (Empire of Cats)|New York's]] base and background.

